ORB-SLAM3 (third_party/ORB_SLAM3)
---------------------------------
- Upstream: https://github.com/UZ-SLAMLab/ORB_SLAM3
- Pinned revision: 4452a3c4ab75b1cde34e5505a36ec3f9edcdc4c4 (upstream V1.0)
- License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (see
  third_party/ORB_SLAM3/LICENSE)
- ORB-SLAM3 is never imported or linked into the `kiwi` package. The session
  wrapper runs as a separate process over an argv/file contract.
- The submodule is the pristine upstream tree. Every local change is an
  auditable diff under third_party/patches/orbslam3/ (keypoint exclude-mask
  plumbing, localization-mode behavior), applied at build time onto a staged
  copy under build/orbslam3/; the patch base commit is recorded in
  third_party/patches/orbslam3/BASE_COMMIT.txt and equals the pinned
  submodule revision. The build never modifies the submodule.
- The resulting binaries are combined GPL-3.0 works; source for the exact
  linked tree is the pinned submodule plus the patch series above.

The first-party wrapper at cpp/orbslam_session/main.cc links against the
ORB-SLAM3 libraries; the built kiwi-orbslam-session binary is therefore a
combined work distributed under GPL-3.0 (a copy of the license sits beside
the wrapper at cpp/orbslam_session/LICENSE). It is the only engine process
the pipeline invokes, over an explicit named-argument contract.

